 # git-flow Lane Protocol (moai-adk-go, local-only)
+
+## Current policy and historical scope
+
+`AGENTS.local.md` §4.0 governs current card delivery: official worker, short card worktree,
+scoped local verification, prompt draft PR, current-head Codex review, and safe handoff before
+independent next work. PR is not done. Only the verified connected user's own non-fork, non-bot
